<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Content Pool Glow Up ✨</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff00ff, #00ffff, #ffff00);
      background-size: 400% 400%;
      animation: bgshift 12s infinite;
      font-family: "Comic Sans MS", "Comic Neue", cursive;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    @keyframes bgshift {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }
    header {
      font-size: 3em;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 20px;
      background: black;
      color: lime;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px #0ff, 2px 2px 15px #f0f;
      border-bottom: 5px double magenta;
    }
    marquee {
      font-size: 20px;
      background: #000;
      color: #ff0;
      padding: 5px;
      border-top: 2px solid white;
      border-bottom: 2px solid white;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      border: 4px ridge #0ff;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff0, 0 0 40px #f0f;
    }
    h2 {
      color: cyan;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px #fff, 0 0 15px #0ff;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6em;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .glow-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #444, #999);
      border: 3px solid #fff;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px #fff, 0 0 10px #aaa;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px #fff, 0 0 25px #999;
      transition: 0.3s;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .glow-btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-2deg);
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #666, #aaa);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px #fff, 0 0 45px #ccc;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #ccc;
      text-shadow: 0 0 3px #fff;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>🚀 Content Pool V2 Glow Up 🚀</header>

  <marquee scrollamount="6">💾 Big Facts: Old Content Pool was kinda mid… but now it’s bussin fr fr 💾</marquee>

  <div class="container">
    <h2>👎 The Struggle Was Real</h2>
    <p>
      Yo fam, not gonna lie… the OG Content Pool was lowkey pain.  
      You had to <strong>dig forever</strong> just to find one vid.  
      No categories. No search. Slow af. And don’t even start on the  
      buffering — vids refused to stream. Straight 1998 dial-up vibes.  
    </p>

    <h2>🔥 The Glow Up</h2>
    <p>
      But guess what? We hit the lab, no cap. Content Pool V2 is now  
      <strong>built different</strong>.  
      ✨ Categories? Pulled up.  
      ✨ Search bar? Bet.  
      ✨ Smooth streaming? Say less.  
      ✨ Load speed? Zoomin like Mario Kart Rainbow Road.  
    </p>

    <h2>🎨 Retro Vibes Only</h2>
    <p>
      And cuz we’re all about that aesthetic, we styled it 90s mode.  
      Bright colors, neon borders, glow text, even a marquee bar like  
      your fav throwback sites. Looks vintage but hits modern.  
    </p>

    <h2>🌐 It’s Live rn!</h2>
    <p>
      No more waiting, no more mid. Content Pool V2 is live,  
      ready for y’all to stream, vibe, and flex. Tap in and see the glow up.  
    </p>

    <button class="glow-btn" onclick="window.location.href='https://www.centralschool.fun/videocave.html'">Enter Content Pool V2</button>
  </div>

  <footer>© 2025 Central Content Pool — serving retro drip + future tech</footer>

</body>
</html>
